        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WL14, Window Lift Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis surface mounted window lift pull can be used on sliding windows, sliding cabinet doors, sliding cabinet drawers - anywhere a small finger pull can be installed. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"375\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-WL14-size.gif?v=1704354677\" width=\"375\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WL14 Window Lift Size\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is normally surface mounted (screwed to the face). Packaged with installation screws. Available in you choice of Polished Brass, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Satin Nickel, or Polished Chrome finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deltana WL14 Window Lift Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 1\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WL14.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WL14 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
